// NLM Error Handling and Recovery System
// 
// This module implements comprehensive error handling and recovery mechanisms
// throughout the NLM (Neural Learning Machine) framework. It provides:
// 
// 1. Centralized error handling framework
// 2. Automatic error recovery and retry mechanisms
// 3. Graceful degradation capabilities
// 4. Enhanced error reporting and diagnostics
// 5. Resource management and cleanup
// 6. State consistency maintenance
// 7. Performance monitoring and error correlation
// 
// Key improvements:
// - Robust error handling in all major components
// - Automatic recovery from transient failures
// - Enhanced error reporting and diagnostics
// - Resource cleanup and management
// - State consistency during failures
// - Performance impact monitoring
// - Configurable error recovery policies

